{"title":"Career roadmap · Mechatronics Engineer","role":"Mechatronics Engineer","summary":"Mechatronics Engineering combines mechanical engineering, electronics, electrical systems, control engineering, embedded systems and software to design and operate intelligent machines.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Mechatronics/automation trainee, controls engineer, robotics engineer, maintenance/production engineer"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"What should I specialise in?","output":"Robotics, PLC/SCADA, controls, motion systems, machine vision or industrial IoT"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior automation/controls/robotics engineer, systems engineer or technical lead"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How do I remain relevant?","output":"Robotics/automation architect, smart-factory specialist, engineering manager or technical director"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Mechatronics Engineer can work across industrial automation, robotics, manufacturing, automotive systems, CNC/PLC systems, industrial IoT, machine vision, motion control and smart factories."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof of progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Engineering foundation"},{"text":"Mathematics, physics, mechanical fundamentals, basic electrical/electronics, C/Python"},{"text":"Build and document basic sensor/actuator projects"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Mechatronics core"},{"text":"Sensors, actuators, microcontrollers, CAD, electrical machines, mechanics"},{"text":"Build an automated electromechanical prototype"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Automation & control"},{"text":"PLC, SCADA, control systems, robotics, pneumatics/hydraulics"},{"text":"Create PLC + HMI + robotic/automation project"}],[{"text":"Year 